+## Agent Session Record export
+
+Export the public `state` object returned by app-server `session/read`:
+
+```bash
+uv run python -m vibe.app_server.agent_session_export --session state.json --format agent-session --output session.asr.jsonl
+```
+
+This offline command preserves public text and readable reasoning in history order.
+It declares missing history, tool details and accounting. It does not read private
+Runtime journals or start a model request. Output files are private and must not
+already exist.
+
 ## Lifecycle: Exit, Update, Version, Resume
 
 ### Exit

